      <link>https://www.manchesterworld.uk/travel/a-swiss-helping-of-wellness-at-the-grand-resort-bad-ragaz-5467727</link>
      <description>It’s not usual to step into a wellness resort and be greeted by a glass wall of fine wines bound for the largest number of Michelin-starred restaurants in one place. And it’s not typical to find a chef’s mouth-watering apple crumble waiting in your room as a welcome gift. But then, the Grand Resort Bad Ragaz is not a typical retreat. Here, wellness extends far beyond the spa embracing indulgence, pleasure and the art of slowing down in a luxurious setting, writes Jane Wilson.</description>
